// Proof of "never require/import the runtime module" (docs/slot-contract.md section 5).
// External identity resolution reads only package.json (JSON.parse) and index.d.ts (a ts-morph
// *type* parse, never executed as JS). If anything in the codegen pipeline ever accidentally
// `require`s/`import`s this file, this throw makes that failure loud and immediate instead of a
// silent behavioral difference.
throw new Error("rf-fixture-widgets/index.js must never be executed by codegen");
